            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.17.21+JER.17.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yere 17:21-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muli shilya nshiku namwene abaume aba mu calo ca Bayuda balenyanta icakukaminamo umwangashi pa bushiku bwe Sabata. Kabili nabalonga iŋanu pali bakabalwe pamo no mwangashi ne fitwalo fya myangashi, imikunyu na fimbipo baleleta fyonse ifi mu Yerusalemu pe Sabata. Kanshi nabakalipila pakulashitisha ifyakulya pali ubu bushiku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili abaume abafumine ku Turi abaleikala mu Yerusalemu nabo baleleta isabi ne fintu fimbi ifyamakwebo no kushitisha mu Yerusalemu ku bantu ba mu calo ca Yuda pa bushiku bwe Sabata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo naebaula na basambashi ba mu calo ca Yuda natila, “Cinshi mulecitila icabipisha ifi, mwakowesha ubushiku bwe Sabata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bushe bashinwe tabacitile ica musango umo wine pakuti Lesa alete amafya pali ifwe no musumba? Kabili imwe mulelundako pakukowesha Isabata pakuti ubukali buponene Israeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi elyo payambile ukufiita, icungulo, pa mpongolo sha Yerusalemu ilyo Isabata talilati lifike, napeela icebo icakuti ifiibi fyonse fisalwe, kabili takuli kufiisula mpakafye panuma ye Sabata. Elyo nabika ababomfi bandi pa mpongolo pakuti ifipe nangu fimo fiingila mu Yerusalemu pe Sabata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Limo limo bashimakwebo na bakashitisha ba fyakulya ifyalekana lekana balesendama kunse ya Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo nalibasokele nati, “Cinshi mulesendamina mupepi ne linga ubushiku? Nga mwabwekeshapo nakabili nkamulopola.” Ukufuma palya pene tabatalile abesa pe Sabata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo napeela abena Levi icebo icakuti baisangulule kabili baye mukulonda impongolo epakushininkisha ukuti Isabata lilesungwa muli bukaele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulenjibukisha pali ici we Lesa wandi, unange uluse lobe ukulingana ne citemwiko cobe icishaikulila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
