                "loc": "EXO.34.11+EXO.34.12+EXO.34.13+EXO.34.14+EXO.34.15+EXO.34.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ukuf 34:11-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.1+DEU.7.2+DEU.7.3+DEU.7.4+DEU.7.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amaf 7:1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili mu nshiku shine isho namwene ukuti Abayuda baupile banamayo ukufuma ku bena Ashidodi, abena Amoni na bena Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na bana bafyelwe muli ifi fyupo, citika balelanda icitundu ca bena Ashidodi, nangu ululimi lwa bantufye bambi. Tabaishibe no kulanda ululimi lwa Ciyuda nakalya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi nabakalipila no kubatipwila. Nasuka naumapo nabamo no kubanukula umushishi. Nabeba nokuti bafwile balapa umulapo mwishina lyakwa Lesa ukuti, “Imwe tamwakatale amuufya abana benu abakashana ku bana ba muli iyi mitundu, nangu ukusuminisha abana benu abaume, nangu imwe bene, ukuupa abakashana ba mishobo imbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.12.24+2SA.12.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 12:24-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.1+1KI.11.2+1KI.11.3+1KI.11.4+1KI.11.5+1KI.11.6+1KI.11.7+1KI.11.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Isham 11:1-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bushe te fyupo fya musango uyu efyalengele ukuti Solomoni mfumu ya bena Israeli acite icabubifi? Mu fyalo fyonse takwali imfumu iyali nga ena. Ali uwatemwikwa kuli Lesa, kabili Lesa amucitile imfumu ya calo ca Israeli conse. Nomba pa mulandu wa banamayo abafumine ku mishobo imbi ecalengele ukuti acite icabubifi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshilefwaya ukumfwa ukuti na imwe mwaibika mu misango iyi iyabipisha, nokutila mulesangukila Lesa wesu pakuupa banamayo abafuma ku mishobo imbi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
